# 让 GitHub 正确识别项目语言（避免把 Vue 前端或 node_modules 统计成主语言）
*.java   linguist-language=Java
*.vue    linguist-language=Vue
*.js     linguist-language=JavaScript
*.scss   linguist-language=SCSS

# 文档类不计入语言统计
*.md     linguist-documentation
*.sql    linguist-documentation

# 排除第三方与构建产物
vue/node_modules/*  linguist-vendored
vue/dist/*          linguist-generated
target/*            linguist-generated
